  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The&#xa0;Future School for Ukraine&#xa0;project, implemented by the Lithuanian Central Project Management Agency, has created a ready-to-implement and free-to-use adaptive technical design for building new schools in Ukraine, with a view to facilitating the reconstruction recovery of Ukraine&#x2019;s education system. The project also includes support for Ukraine in updating building regulations to align with EU standards as part of its accession process.</narrative>
